  visual language as the library tile context menu
  (game_context_popup.xml + bg_game_context.xml): compact 40 dp rows on
  a 16 dp rounded panel, colors follow the M3/Material You palette.
  Shown by MainActivity.showToolbarMenu() anchored below the app bar.

